===Parliament===
[[File:2020 Ghanaian parliamentary election by constituency.svg|thumb|Results of the 2020 Ghanaian parliamentary election by constituency]]

There has been a long delay in declaring the final result in the parliamentary election. On 14 December, a week after voting was completed, the Electoral Commission announced that it was working on finalising the results for Sene West constituency.<ref>{{cite web |title=We're finalizing processes to declare Sene West election results - EC |url=https://www.ghanaweb.com/GhanaHomePage/NewsArchive/We-re-finalizing-processes-to-declare-Sene-West-election-results-EC-1133642 |website=ghanaweb.com |access-date=16 December 2020 |language=en |date=15 December 2020}}</ref>

